<p>
    The set of three vectors <m>\{v,w,u\}</m> below is linearly dependent:
    <ul>
      <li><p><m>u</m> is in <m>\Span\{v,w\}</m>, so we can apply the first <xref ref="linindep-criterion-inspan">criterion</xref>.</p></li>
      <li><p>The span did not increase when we added <m>u</m>, so we can apply the <xref ref="linindep-increasing-span">increasing span criterion</xref>.</p></li>
    </ul>
    In the picture below, note that <m>v</m> is in <m>\Span\{u,w\}</m>, and <m>w</m> is in <m>\Span\{u,v\}</m>, so we can remove any of the three vectors without shrinking the span.
    </p>
