<p>
    Note that three vectors are linearly dependent if and only if they are <em>coplanar</em>.  Indeed, <m>\{v,w,u\}</m> is linearly dependent if and only if one vector is in the span of the other two, which is a plane (or a line) (or <m>\{0\}</m>).
    </p>

    <p>The four vectors <m>\{v,w,u,x\}</m> below are linearly dependent: they are the columns of a <xref ref="linindep-wide-matrix">wide matrix</xref>.  Note however that <m>u</m> is not contained in <m>\Span\{v,w,x\}</m>.  See <xref ref="linindep-not-any"/>.</p>

