        </statement>
        <solution xml:id="solution-li-12">
          <p>This is a set of five vectors in <m>\R^3</m>.  <xref provisional="theorem-?"/> says the set is linearly dependent.  Boom.</p>
        </solution>
      </exercise>

      <exercise xml:id="exercise-li-13">
