<mrow>\begin{pmatrix}
\leading1 \amp 0 \amp 0 \amp 0 \\
0 \amp \leading1 \amp 0 \amp 0 \\
0 \amp 0 \amp \leading1 \amp 0 \\
0 \amp 0 \amp 0 \amp \leading1 \\
0 \amp 0 \amp 0 \amp 0
\end{pmatrix}</mrow>
</md>.Since every column has a pivot, the theorem says the vectors are linearly independent.</p>
        </solution>
